#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Data behind the programmatic pages.

Every entry here becomes a page that is genuinely different from the others:
different rates, different thresholds, different costs, different advice. A
template with one word swapped is a doorway page, which Google removes. The
per-entry `notes` and `costs` fields are what keep these pages real.

Rates are prefilled defaults, not assertions. Every page tells the reader to
check the current figure, and the field stays editable.
"""

