#   hours    billable hours a week that are realistic in THIS field
#   expenses annual business costs typical for THIS field
#   costs    the actual line items, named
#   drivers  what genuinely moves the rate up in this field
#   note     two or three sentences true of this field and not of the others
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
